      "body": "# metrics-router cutover status\n\nStatus as of Dec 18, 2023:\n- `metrics-router` is not using `legacy-aggregator` in the live path.\n- `legacy-aggregator` mirrored writes have been stopped.\n- `legacy-aggregator` remains only as archived legacy code.\n\nValidation after the legacy mirror stop:\n- Use live-path OTel/Prometheus signals for production health.\n- Use Cardinality Guardrails fixtures for the covered label-change validation cases.\n- Do not use legacy mirrored writes as an active replay source.\n- Do not use `legacy-aggregator` as a production rollback path.\n\nResponder note:\n- If an older dashboard, annotation, or runbook still refers to an active legacy mirror, treat that reference as stale until it is cleaned or explicitly tagged.\n- Replay or validation-source movement is investigation evidence only; it is not live rollback criteria by itself.",
