args.body:
Hello,

Devika and I are open to a neutral seven-night bedroom measurement, but we are not accepting placement until the device and data handling are defined. Please confirm:

- whether the logger records intelligible audio or only sound-level and frequency measurements;
- who can access the device data;
- how long raw and processed data will be retained;
- the proposed bedroom placement and whether its location can be adjusted; and
- how readings will be interpreted, including whether they could be used to attribute the sound to a particular unit.

No source unit has been identified, and we are not agreeing to placement yet. We will continue exact recurrence logging in the meantime.

Best,
Alex

